file: manuals/
consumers: [GreatVibe users, Mochi agents, documentation maintainers]
produces: [public manual collections]
---
# Purpose
Contains public-safe manual sets grouped by work area.

# Key Files
- `productivity/` contains practical document, spreadsheet, review, and
  work-management guides.

# Dependencies
- `../CATALOGUE.md` routes users and agents into the relevant manual set.
- `../SANITIZATION.md` defines publication safety checks.

# Gotchas
- Keep manuals user-facing. Do not include internal systems, private URLs,
  credentials, customer data, or operational commands.

# Change History
- 2026-08-03: Added folder ACE for the public manuals area.
